# Brand name

The product is **MarketRegular** — one word, camel case. Never “Market Regular”.

User-facing brand copy (wordmark, titles, metadata, footer, alt text) must use `SITE_NAME` from `@/lib/constants`. Do not hardcode a spaced name.

The domain `marketregular.com` is already one word. “Regular” as a person (regulars, a regular) is fine.
